{"id":"9rc2n4bkmv","doi":{"id":"10.17632/9rc2n4bkmv.1","status":"allocated","prefix":"10.17632"},"name":"Functional interrogation of a SARS-CoV-2 host protein interactome identifies unique and shared coronavirus host factors. Hoffmann et al.","description":"The ongoing SARS-CoV-2 pandemic has devastated the global economy and claimed more than one million lives, presenting an urgent global health crisis. To identify host factors required for infection by SARS-CoV-2 and seasonal coronaviruses, we designed a focused high-coverage CRISPR-Cas9 library targeting 332 members of a recently published SARS-CoV-2 protein interactome. We leveraged the compact nature of this library to systematically screen SARS-CoV-2 at two physiologically relevant temperatures (33 ºC and 37 ºC) along with three related coronaviruses (HCoV-229E, HCoV-NL63, and HCoV-OC43), allowing us to probe this interactome at a much higher resolution relative to genome scale studies. This approach yielded several new insights, including unexpected virus-specific differences in Rab GTPase requirements and GPI anchor biosynthesis, as well as identification of multiple pan-coronavirus factors involved in cholesterol homeostasis. This coronavirus essentiality catalog could inform ongoing drug development efforts aimed at intercepting and treating COVID-19, and help prepare for future coronavirus outbreaks.","version":1,"contributors":[{"profile_id":"8c58c92b-ca76-30ba-aaf8-1d076f2f749a","first_name":"JT","last_name":"Poirier"}],"files":[{"filename":"Table-S1.xlsx","id":"ba323c5b-9c7b-4dd7-91ff-c2808e1c7028","content_details":{"id":"ba313ff8-4690-444c-abc1-b60ad20a1d55","sha256_hash":"55804834749027216dd12385270eafc2e43174009f0318997785c49017069955","content_type":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","size":1296120,"created_date":"2020-11-24T20:45:28.549Z","download_url":"https://data.mendeley.com/public-files/datasets/9rc2n4bkmv/files/ba323c5b-9c7b-4dd7-91ff-c2808e1c7028/file_downloaded","view_url":"https://data.mendeley.com/public-files/datasets/9rc2n4bkmv/files/ba323c5b-9c7b-4dd7-91ff-c2808e1c7028/file_viewed","download_expiry_time":"2126-11-07T17:53:53.39022143Z"},"metrics":{"downloads":0,"previews":0},"size":1296120,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"filename":"Table-S2.xlsx","id":"2b3a824c-2fad-4135-9d6b-d9f0dc2d374b","content_details":{"id":"20e3e8e1-772b-46dd-a920-605a410ffdda","sha256_hash":"fb89e80a9fa8d2d531a502a28e9c2e4498d5ed550586d2d3c4c351ac32d15294","content_type":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","size":704382,"created_date":"2020-11-24T20:45:28.466Z","download_url":"https://data.mendeley.com/public-files/datasets/9rc2n4bkmv/files/2b3a824c-2fad-4135-9d6b-d9f0dc2d374b/file_downloaded","view_url":"https://data.mendeley.com/public-files/datasets/9rc2n4bkmv/files/2b3a824c-2fad-4135-9d6b-d9f0dc2d374b/file_viewed","download_expiry_time":"2126-11-07T17:53:53.3902257Z"},"metrics":{"downloads":0,"previews":0},"size":704382,"status":"COMPLETED"}],"versions":[{"version":1,"available":true,"publish_date":"2020-11-25T19:01:19.445Z"}],"articles":[],"categories":[{"id":"data.elsevier.com/vocabulary/OmniScience/Concept-253238290","label":"Coronavirus"},{"id":"data.elsevier.com/vocabulary/OmniScience/Concept-528161844","label":"Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus 2"},{"id":"data.elsevier.com/vocabulary/OmniScience/Concept-528161854","label":"COVID-19"}],"institutions":[],"metrics":{"views":0,"file_downloads":0,"file_previews":0},"available":true,"size":2000502,"owner":{"profile_id":"8c58c92b-ca76-30ba-aaf8-1d076f2f749a","first_name":"JT","last_name":"Poirier"},"channel":"WEB","owner_id":"8c58c92b-ca76-30ba-aaf8-1d076f2f749a","publish_date":"2020-11-25T19:01:19.445Z","data_licence":{"id":"01d9c749-3c4d-4431-9df3-620b2dcfe144","description":"You can share, copy and modify this dataset so long as you give appropriate credit, provide a link to the CC BY license, and indicate if changes were made, but you may not do so in a way that suggests the rights holder has endorsed you or your use of the dataset. Note that further permission may be required for any content within the dataset that is identified as belonging to a third party.","url":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","category":"Creative","short_name":"CC BY 4.0","full_name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International"},"related_links":[],"funders":[],"customer_id":"7377952c-6404-4428-bbfc-77242cfc301e","modified_on":"2020-11-24T20:45:59.066Z","created_on":"2020-11-24T20:42:39.567Z","confidential":false,"links":{"view":"https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/9rc2n4bkmv"},"repository":{"id":"MENDELEY_DATA","name":"Mendeley Data"}}